// 007.4: an Immunity with `Related to` protects its holder only where the components it shares with the act match.
Fact agent Identified by Ava
Fact proposer Identified by Cal
Fact amendment Identified by Good, Bad
Fact ratified Identified by amendment
Fact weakens-floor Identified by amendment

Act ratify Actor proposer Recipient agent Related to amendment
  Holds when True
  Creates ratified(amendment)

Immunity ratchet Holder agent Related to amendment
  Against ratify
  Holds when weakens-floor(amendment)
.

+weakens-floor(Bad).
?!valid ratify(Cal, Ava, Bad).
?valid ratify(Cal, Ava, Good).
ratify(Cal, Ava, Bad).
?!ratified(Bad).
ratify(Cal, Ava, Good).
?ratified(Good).
